<title>JAPAN: Marusan Sec -6mth prelim parent results.</title>
<headline>Marusan Sec -6mth prelim parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     9.72		vs	    8.91</p>
<p> Current		1.98		vs	  914    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.97		vs	  727    million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.3 yen	   vs	    9.4 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Marusan Securities Co Ltd is an independent</p>
<p>comprehensive securities firm. The figures announced</p>
<p>on Tuesday were preliminary figures and it would announce</p>
<p>its final half year earnings on October 22.</p>
</text>
